  "notes": [
    "Profiles are aligned to the five stable Runtime targets published on 2026-09-06: MangoX2 Pico/Pico W/Pico 2 W v0.2.6 and MangoLite Pico W/Pico 2 W v0.6.0.",
    "Host Python profiles use the current Host Student API package 0.4.6 distributed through the MangoThonny v0.4.0 teaching environment.",
    "A profile capability means the learner API path exists for the selected target and mode. Physical module presence, current Enable state, wiring health, and hardware validation are separate states.",
    "MangoX2 line_tracking is intentionally absent from Host profiles because the default GP12/GP13 line-tracking profile conflicts with active Host UART ownership.",
    "MangoLite legacy distance/line_tracking/obstacle paths are intentionally not promoted until their shared contracts are migrated."
  ]
